description:
Create a task on a property. Requires title. Optional: description, assignee user id, priority (1-5, default 3), taskbox (column UUID or a status keyword: todo, in_progress, qa, done — case-insensitive; default TO-DO column), due_date (YYYY-MM-DD, the task Goal Date), parent (a ticket UUID, slug, or browser URL — creates the task as that ticket's subtask). To make the task an applyable native SEO change, also pass targetUrl (absolute page URL), field (one of: meta_title, meta_description, h1, canonical, robots_meta, og_title, og_description, image_alt) and proposedValue; optionally platform (shopify|webflow|wordpress), currentValue, rationale. Nothing is applied automatically — the change is only proposed and needs explicit approval.

Cost: 2 credits per call.

Examples:
```json
// create a task in the TO-DO column with a goal date
{"property":"sc-domain:example.com","title":"Optimize the pricing page meta description","taskbox":"todo","dueDate":"2026-05-28"}

// create the task as a subtask of an existing ticket (referenced by slug).
{"property":"sc-domain:example.com","title":"Draft the H1 variants","parent":"optimize-the-pricing-page"}

// create an actionable task carrying a proposed native SEO change (approval + apply happen later).
{"property":"sc-domain:example.com","title":"Rewrite the pricing page meta title","targetUrl":"https://example.com/pricing","platform":"shopify","field":"meta_title","currentValue":"Pricing","proposedValue":"Pricing Plans & Costs (2026) — Example","rationale":"Low CTR at avg position 6; the current title is generic."}
```
